  + [authority_scope] is P8 final slice order, fixture obligation inventory, fixture path policy, generated-output nonpromotion, fixture materialization plan, implementation activation boundary, stale false-ready contradiction and fault oracle plan, proof ledger, evaluation acceptance, downstream gate, model routing, safety limits, and completion review obligations
